\image(figures/double_descent.svg)
// result_end

The vertical line marks the 32 fitting observations. Interpolation
produces vanishing training error from that point onward, while the
median held-out error rises sharply at width 32 and then falls. The
mean test error is reported separately because a few nearly singular
draws can dominate it near interpolation.
